  "diagnostic_limits": "Full-packet attempts are not accepted. Initial harness errors were fixed; the actual dependent proof-function gap was isolated and corrected. Complete replay subsequently required a literal polynomial and exhausted both 100k and 5M budgets. Frozen2 was operator-interrupted with SIGINT; its smart-unfolding stack is not a completed sample. Frozen3/4/5 are terminal budget exhaustions. The frozen3 stack shows ordinary kernel reduction and is a single observation, not a cumulative profile. The current scratch file additionally substitutes the existing proved frozen reduction but has not yet been built. Historical CI failure belongs to remote1b0f and is retained for its obsolete86/14 inventory; local targeted correction checks94/14 with unchanged guard.",
